      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1903-10-17_WidnesExaminer_art0036" n="art0036">
        <head>FIRST 'GARDEN CITY.</head>
        <p>THE FIRST 'GARDEN CITY.</p>
        <p>The "First Garden City, Limited," as the Utopion township which is beginning to take shape in Hertfordshire is commercially known, occupies about 380 acres between Itchin and Baldock, and is in the heart of some of the most charming rustic scenery within Loo miles of London. What prospective residents, workmen, and manufacturers wish to know,</p>
