      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1903-10-17_WidnesExaminer_art0078" n="art0078">
        <head>THIS WILL INTRRBST YOU. MAR VBLLOUS BARGAINS.</head>
        <p>THIS WILL INTRRBST YOU. MAR VBLLOUS BARGAINS.</p>
        <p>rll/111 GLADYS GLASS SYNDICATE having purchased a 1 large consignment of glass suites consisting of the following 12 large tumblers, 12 small tumblers, 12 port wine glasses, 12 sherry glasses, 12 liqueur glasses, 12 claret glasses, 2 quart decanters (cut neck and stoppers). and 1 claret jug (cut neck and stopper), all beautifully etched, offer the same at the extremely low price of £1 18s. 6d. per suite. Also a SPIRIT TANTALUS CASH containing 3 decanters in oak frame, nickel fiqings. and key. Price 185. 6d. Both these articles carriage paid any distance in the United Kingdom. Money returned if not approved of. This wonderful offer only remains good during the period of this advertisement. Both or either of thee lines make a handsome Christmas, Wedding, or other Present. Order immediately to ensure delivbry. Illustrated catalogues on receipt of postcard to GkanYS GLASS SYNDICATE, 294 Camberwell New-road, London, SR. Agents required. Write for particulars.</p>
        <p>COMMERCIAL PRINTING.</p>
        <p>OIRCULtILS ;n the neatest style, from moier type, and of the best workmanship. CLUB AND SOCIETY CARDS. "EXAMINER" OFFICE.</p>
