        <p>no more invigorating food exists than porridge made from</p>
        <p>' Provost' Oats.</p>
        <p>It is the people with the good appetites who inherit the earth.</p>
        <p>Your appetite always remains</p>
        <p>good while you take ' Provost '</p>
        <p>Oats porridge, which means</p>
        <p>that it keeps you in a healthy</p>
        <p>and brainy condition.</p>
