        <p>PILES AND INDIGESTION CURED.</p>
        <p>Do not neglect FILM, Fistula3may follow. KBUTTS CUBE is the only safe and effectual remedy for inward. out. ward. and bleeding riles or Fistula. It acts like a charm on the Blood. and causes them to disappear like magic. It is a pos itve cure for the most acute forms of Chronic Indiges- tion. One bottle will convince you, price is. 14d. Soldby BOOTS and all Chemists.</p>
